1 NAME Carl Henrik /von Hofsten/ RSO
2 GIVN Carl Henrik
2 NSFX RSO
2 _MARNM von Hofsten
1 NAME Henrik von Hofsten
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 22 JUN 1846
2 PLAC Karlsborgs fästning
2 ADDR
3 CITY Karlsborg
3 CTRY Sweden
1 DEAT
2 DATE 4 OCT 1919
2 PLAC Jäxbo
2 ADDR
3 ADR1 Malma
3 CITY Köping
