1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ===SIR PATRICK BLACKADDER OF TULLIALLAN===
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Sir Patrick Blackadder of Tuliallan, here treated, married Elizabeth Edmonstone, with whose consent, on 25 February 1485, she exchanged her half share of the barony of Boyne in Aberdeenshire for her sisters share of the barony 
2 CONC of Tulliallan in Perthshire. [https://archive.org/details/registrummagnisi02scot/page/345/mode/1up RMS 1424-1513: 1644] His wife was daughter and co-heiress, with her sister Margaret, of Janet, Lady Edmonstone. [http://catalogue.n
2 CONC rscotland.gov.uk/nrsonlinecatalogue/details.aspx?reference=GD15%2f343&st=1&tc=y&tl=n&tn=n&tp=n&k=boyne&ko=p&r=&ro=s&df=&dt=1500&di=n NRS: GD15/343]'''
2 CONT
