2 CONT '''3 June 1484: Instrument of Resignation by Janet, Lady of Edmoundstoune in favour of Elizabeth and Margaret Edmoundstoune, her daughters, of lands of Tullealloun and the thanedom of Boyne. Witnesses:- Sir John Hog, Thomas Knolli
2 CONC s, David Gryndlaw, Gilbert Smyth and Alexander Hog. [http://catalogue.nrscotland.gov.uk/nrsonlinecatalogue/details.aspx?reference=GD15%2f343&st=1&tc=y&tl=n&tn=n&tp=n&k=boyne&ko=p&r=&ro=s&df=&dt=1500&di=n National Records of Scotla
