2 CONC Tulliallan] with the donation and patronage of the kirk of the same in the sheriffdom of Peyrt [Perth] and stewartry of Strachteryne [Strathearn] into the hands of the King his father and the gift thereof thereupon made to John of
2 CONC  Blacadyr son to the said Patrick and Elizabeth and his heirs. At Tongland, 6 Mar 1488/1489. [http://catalogue.nrscotland.gov.uk/nrsonlinecatalogue/details.aspx?reference=RH6%2f544&st=1&tc=y&tl=n&tn=n&tp=n&k=elizabeth+edmonston&ko
