1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ===CHRISTIAN BRUCE===
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Christian Bruce is said to have been the daughter of Sir David Bruce of Clackmanan and his wife Mariot Herries. She is also said to have married James Schaw of Sauchie, but it is not yet clear which James Schaw was her husband.
2 CONC  [https://archive.org/details/scotspeeragefoun03paul/page/471/mode/1up The Scots Peerage III: 471] [https://www.stirnet.com/genie/data/british/bb4fz/bruce03.php Stirnet: Bruce 03]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT === Christian Bruce
2 CONT *Father	Sir David Bruce
2 CONT *Mother	Marion Herries1
2 CONT
2 CONT Christian Bruce married Sir James Shaw.1
2 CONT
2 CONT Family
2 CONT *Sir James Shaw of Sauchie  Children	- unconfirmed 
2 CONT *Ellen Shaw+2
2 CONT *Janet Shaw+2 b. c 1455
2 CONT *Joan Shaw+3 b. c 1495
2 CONT
