2 CONC ps://archive.org/stream/scotspeeragefoun03pauluoft#page/472/mode/2up/search/%22James+Shaw%22 Archive.Org]  Christian Bruce married Sir James Shaw of Sauchie.
2 CONT *2.  [S61] Unknown author, Family Group Sheets, Family History Archives, SLC.
2 CONT *3.  [S11597] Ancestry.com, Information submitted by brentwr.
