2 CONC f Bargadye and others. [https://catalogue.nrscotland.gov.uk/nrsonlinecatalogue/details.aspx?reference=RH6%2f1572&st=1&tc=y&tl=n&tn=n&tp=n&k=cristina+reid&ko=p&r=&ro=s&df=&dt=&di=n National Records of Scotland, Register House chart
2 CONC ers, 1st series, reference RH6/1572]'''
