2 CONT == Evidence from the National Records of Scotland ==
2 CONT
2 CONT '''9 June 1604: Charter by which Alani Cowtiss of Wester Rossyith confirms, following an agreement between him and  George Bruce of Carnock, that he has sold the church lands and glebe of Rossyith to Edward, Lord Bruce of Kinloss,
2 CONC  brother german of George Bruce of Carnock, and Lord Edward's wife Magdalene Clerk for her lifetime, and Lord Edward's son and heir Edward Bruce. Edward, Lord Bruce of Kinloss ontained a charter of confirmation under the Great Sea
2 CONC l of Scotland on 4 September 1605. [https://archive.org/details/registrummagnisi06scot/page/605/mode/1up RMS 1593-1608: charter number 1671]'''
2 CONT
