2 CONT *''''''     Edward Bruce, 1st Lord Bruce of Kinloss married Magdalen Clerk, daughter of Sir Alexander Clerk.3 Edward Bruce, 1st Lord Bruce of Kinloss was born in 1548 at of Easter Kennet, Scotland.1 He died on 14 January 1611; Bur
2 CONC ied in Rolls Chapel, Chancery Lane, London. Age 62.1,2
