2 CONT ===Burgess of Culross; Bailie of Culross===
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT <blockquote>'''Rob. Bruce de Eister Kennet, Geo. B. ejus fratre (1582) George Bruce in Culros (1585) George Bruce, indweller of the town of Culross (1586) George Bruce in Culross  (1600) George Bruce of Carnock (1608) Sir George B
2 CONC ruce of Carnock (1610) Sir George Bruce of Carnock (1612) Sir George Bruce of Carnox (1614) Sir George Bruce of Carnok, knight (1619) Sir George Bruce of Carnok, knight (1622) Domini Georgii Bruce de Carnock, militis (1625)'''</bl
2 CONC ockquote>
