2 CONT '''9 August 1625: Service of George Bruce of Carnok as heir to his father Sir George Bruce of Carnok in certain lands and annualrents in the burgh of Culros. [https://catalogue.nrscotland.gov.uk/nrsonlinecatalogue/details.aspx?ref
2 CONC erence=GD15%2f543&st=1&tc=y&tl=n&tn=n&tp=n&k=george+bruce&ko=p&r=&ro=s&df=&dt=1625&di=y National Records of Scotland, Erskine family of Cardross, Perthshire, reference GD15/543]'''
2 CONT
2 CONT                    35
2 CONT
2 CONT '''9 August 1625: Instrument of Sasine following on precept furth of Chancery in favour of George Bruce of Carnok as heir to deceased Sir George Bruce of Carnok, knight, his father, of lands of Byregrange, Wodeheid, Petticommoun, 
2 CONC and other lands in burgh of Culros, with saltworks therein. [https://catalogue.nrscotland.gov.uk/nrsonlinecatalogue/details.aspx?reference=GD15%2f162&st=1&tc=y&tl=n&tn=n&tp=n&k=george+bruce&ko=p&r=&ro=s&df=&dt=1625&di=n National R
2 CONC ecords of Scotland, Erskine family of Cardross, Perthshire, reference GD15/162]'''
