2 CONT                    36
2 CONT
2 CONT '''1622-28: 8 Inhibitions by Mr. Robert Bruce, son to deceased Sir George Bruce of Carnock against heritors and others of the parish of Torrie and heritors and others of the lands of Poffillis and Blair in lordship of Culross, for
2 CONC  payment of teinds. [https://catalogue.nrscotland.gov.uk/nrsonlinecatalogue/details.aspx?reference=GD15%2f448&st=1&tc=y&tl=n&tn=n&tp=n&k=george+bruce&ko=p&r=&ro=s&df=&dt=1625&di=n National Records of Scotland, Erskine family of Ca
