2 CONT                    37
2 CONT
2 CONT '''30 September 1625: Precept of Sasine furth of Chancery in favour of George Bruce now of Carnok as heir to deceased Sir George Bruce, knight, of Carnok, his father, of the greater half called the north half of the lands and baro
2 CONC ny of Carnok and the lands of Gallorig and Clune lying, by annexation, in the parish of Pettincrieff. [https://catalogue.nrscotland.gov.uk/nrsonlinecatalogue/details.aspx?reference=GD15%2f544&st=1&tc=y&tl=n&tn=n&tp=n&k=george+bruc
