2 CONT 11. Ronald Masterton of Parkmill had a charter from John, Earl of Mar, 1570 ; married Marjory Bruce, of the Clackmannan family, daughter of Robert of Lintmill.
2 CONT
2 CONT Gilbert Masterton, who figures 1595-96 as a dependant of the Earl of Mar, was probably of this family. Mr. John Colville writes to Robert Bowes that he is to be there one of these days with Highland men from Mar ; and later David 
2 CONC Foulis advises Lord Burleigh that Gilbert is not presently in England.
