2 CONT == His Mother's Last Will and Testament ==
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Marion Bruce, Lady Airth, the wife of Magnus Sinclair of Kynninmonth, made her last will and testament on 18 June 1575. It was made in the Burgh of Dysart in Fife. She nominated and constituted her husband https://www.geni.com/
2 CONC people/Magnus-Sinclair-of-Kynninmonth/6000000193466545830?through=6000000193466079848 and her second son https://www.geni.com/people/Robert-Bruce-of-Baldrig/6000000199157960835 to be her only executors and intromitters with her wh
2 CONC ole goods and gear. Confirmation was granted to the executors on 11 August 1575. [National Records of Scotland, Edinburgh Commissary Court, The Testament Testamentar and Inventory of Marioun Bruce, Lady Airth, sometime spouse to M
2 CONC agnus Sinclair in Kynninmonth, reference CC8/8/3]'''
