1 NOTE Took the family name Grimbeck, as did his brothers.
2 CONT He studied at the university in Lund 1728. (unclear if that is theyear he started his universities studies or the only year he spentin Lund). Became priest in 1733.
2 CONT He became a priest and was "Komminister" i.e. assistant pastor inLandvetter 1742.
2 CONT His wife:Christina Maria Sperringhs born around 1714 passed away atthe Admirality Dockyard in Gothenburg 17 August 1789.
