2 CONT
2 CONT '''Johan Peter af Bjerkén'''
2 CONT
2 CONT * * 1773-06-04
2 CONT * ~ 1773-06-06
2 CONT * 1809 [http://sv.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kategori:RSO RSO], [http://sv.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sv%C3%A4rdsorden Svärds-Orden]
2 CONT * oo 1813-03-14 at [http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bjurum Stora Bjurum], Westergöthland with ''Margareta Catharina Lillje af Aspenäs'', * 1790-03-18, † 1846-11-16; daughter to ''Brynte Lillje af Aspenäs'' and his ooI, ''Amalia Odhel
2 CONC ius''.
2 CONT * † 1844-12-18
2 CONT * [ ] 1845-01-03
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Johan Peter''' (son af Gustaf Bjerkén, Nobil. och Adopt. af Bjerkén, Tab. 2), f. 1773 4/6; Volontär vid [http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Savolax_Infantry_Regiment Savolax reg:te] 1785; Fänrik vid [http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kain
2 CONC uu_Brigade Cajana bataljon] [Kainuun, Kajaani] 1791; Löjtnant derst.; Riddare af Svärds-Orden 1809; Löjtnant vid Westerbottens reg:te; Kapten i Arméen 1810; Kapten vid Kronobergs reg:te; Majors afsked 1822; † 1844 18/12. — Gift 18
2 CONC 13 14/3 på Stora Bjurum i Westergöthland med ''Margaretha Catharina Lillje af Aspenäs'', f. 1790 18/3, † 1846 16/11; dotter af Brynte Lillje af Aspenäs, N:o 109, till Stora Bjurum, med hans 1:a fru, Amalia Odhelius.
2 CONT
2 CONT Barn:
2 CONT
2 CONT * ''Amalia Margaretha'', f. 1815.
2 CONT * ''Johanna Gustafva Brynhilda'', f. 1816 30/12.
2 CONT * ''Brynte Carl Johan Gustaf'', f. 1818 17/2 på Thorsjö; Landtmäteri-Auskultant.
2 CONT * ''Fredrica Lovisa Mathilda'', f. 1821 23/4.
2 CONT
2 CONT ------------------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT '''References / Notes'''
2 CONT
2 CONT * Anrep, Johan Gabriel. (1858). ''Svenska adelns ättar-taflor.'' s.v. “Afdelning 1. Abrahamsson —  Granfelt / Adel. ätten af Bjerkén, N:o 1995. / Tab. 2. & Tab. 3.” Stockholm: P.A. Norstedt & Söner. Projekt Runeberg, pp. [http://r
2 CONC uneberg.org/anrep/1/0208.html 200], [http://runeberg.org/anrep/1/0209.html 201]. (accessed January 10, 2013).
2 CONT
2 CONT * National Archives of Sweden (RA, SVAR). '''1749–1791'''. (1773). Uppsala, [http://www.svar.ra.se/image.asp?imageid=C0005416_00060 Vendel parish matricula of births and baptisms, image 60], ID C0005416_00060. SE/ULA/11683/C/5. Na
2 CONC tional Archives of Sweden (RA) & Swedish archive information (SVAR), Stockholm & Ramsele, Sweden. (accessed January 11, 2013). — '' '''baptism 1773''' ''
2 CONT
2 CONT * National Archives of Sweden (RA, SVAR). '''1839–1860'''. (1844). Jönköping, [http://www.svar.ra.se/image.asp?imageid=C0005416_00060 Bottnaryd parish matricula defunctorum, p. 127, image 80], ID C0019930_00080. SE/VALA/00043/C I/
2 CONC 3. National Archives of Sweden (RA) & Swedish archive information (SVAR), Stockholm & Ramsele, Sweden. (accessed January 11, 2013). — '' '''death 1844''' ''
